'''Burgo-Tierradorian relations''' define the bilateral national relationship between the [[Tierrador|Tierradorian Woqalate]] and the [[Burgundie|Burgoignesc Thalattocracy]]. Burgundie was one of the first [[Occident|Occidental]] nations to interact with Tierrador, making first contact in 1427. From that point on, Burgoignesc traders had indirectly influenced the early modern economy of Tierrador, along with considerable influence on Tierrador's [[Tierradorian Defense Forces|defense forces]], specifically in the [[Tierrador Navy|naval]] aspect. 

