'''Metaorizonal''' ([[Burgoignesc language|Burgoignesc]]: '''Beyond the horizon''') is a school of naval military thought pioneered and espoused by the nation of [[Burgundie]] and its [[Navy of Burgundie|navy]]. It has since been adopted by many great and second-rate naval powers globally, and is one of the primary branches of modern naval thinking alongside air group dominance, green water defense and support, and submarine infiltration doctrines.

