The '''Arcer General Staff''', also referred to as the '''General Staff of Arcerion''' is the senior group of officers, enlisted and civilian staff who serve as the commanders of the [[Armed Forces of Arcerion]]. The General Staff assists in the planning, command and control role through the planning, analysis, intelligence gathering, and coordination of multiple armed services components, as well as through coordination with senior political and bureaucratic staff of the Arcer Ministry of Defense. It also creates plans and supervises the deployment and execution of military forces, both domestic and internationally. The staff is organised into multiple functions, including personnel management, intelligence, operations, logistics and sustainment, plans, signals and communications, training, and finance. The General Staff is located at the National Defense Headquarters Building in Arcerion's Capital, [[Kurst Capital Region|Kurst]].

