A '''samacar''' is a type of rural settlement located at high elevations in eastern [[Urcea]], typically within highland climate zones which ring the [[Urcean frontier]] the [[Ionian Mountains|Ionian]] and northern [[Hortus Mountains]]. Samacars are historically distinguished from other remote rural settlements by shared predominantly [[Celtic people|Celtic]] heritage, shared cuisine and agricultural products which likely emerged over time from trade between samacars, and the integration of the settlement into regional economic and political systems while employing their remoteness as a form of defense. 

